# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BetterBasket assignment .gitignore
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What is intentionally tracked:
#   - README.md, solution.md, solutioneasyexplained.md, app.md, CLAUDE.md
#   - betterbasket_matcher/, scripts/, tests/, eval/
#   - docs/ (dataset_audit.md, algorithm_recommendation.md, HANDOFF.md,
#           audit_stats.json, retrieval_probe_results.json, and derived .md)
#   - pytest.ini, requirements.txt
#   - .claude/skills/ (agent workflow visible to reviewers)
#
# What is NOT tracked by default (but may be force-added at submission time):
#   - matches.csv: the deliverable. Ignored until it passes the 10-check
#     validation (>=4,000 rows, both PDF regressions, numeric IDs, etc.).
#     Include it at submission time with `git add -f matches.csv`.
#   - matches_audit.csv: ~15MB debug/audit output, regenerated every run.
#     Kept out of git permanently; compress (.csv.gz) if ever delivered.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Agent workflow ---------------------------------------------------------
# .claude/skills/ IS tracked on purpose so reviewers can see the Claude skills
# used during development. Only local state (settings.local.json) is excluded.
# .agents/ is a duplicate of .claude/skills/ and intentionally ignored.
.agents/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# --- IDE local state --------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# --- BetterBasket assignment brief (do not redistribute) -------------------
# Brackets are glob character classes in .gitignore, so escape them.
\[BetterBasket\] Engineering Technical Assessment.pdf
*Engineering Technical Assessment*.pdf

# --- Python bytecode and build artifacts -----------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.egg
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.eggs/
pip-wheel-metadata/
.wheel-cache/

# --- Virtual environments --------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.python-version

# --- Test / type-check / coverage caches -----------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/

# --- Jupyter / IPython (in case of scratch notebooks) ----------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb_checkpoints

# --- OS cruft --------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# --- Secrets and credentials (never commit these) --------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
openai_creds.yaml
openai_creds.yml
**/openai_creds.yaml
**/openai_creds.yml
*creds*.yaml
*creds*.yml
*credentials*.yaml
*credentials*.yml
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
.secrets/

# --- Large source datasets (live in ~/Downloads, never vendor them) --------
grocery_store_a_items_final.csv
grocery_store_b_items_final.csv
*_items_final.csv
data/raw/
datasets/

# --- Local pipeline scratch / logs -----------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
tmp/
.tmp/
scratch/
.scratch/
out/local/
runs/
wandb/
# TCC working copy of the real Walmart/Wegmans CSVs; see HANDOFF Phase 8.
/tmp/betterbasket_data/

# --- Pipeline outputs -------------------------------------------------------
# matches.csv: ignored until it passes the 10-check validation contract
# (>=4,000 rows, both PDF regressions, no duplicate item_id_A, etc.).
# At submission time, force-add with: git add -f matches.csv
matches.csv
# matches_audit.csv: 15MB debug trace regenerated every run; never commit.
matches_audit.csv
# smoke / temporary run artifacts
smoke_matches.csv
smoke_audit.csv

# --- Editor swap / backup files --------------------------------------------
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*~
